<title>POLAND: Olivetti wins Polish Pekao SA ATM order.</title>
<headline>Olivetti wins Polish Pekao SA ATM order.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of Italy's computer group Olivetti said on Friday it had won an order from Poland's Bank Pekao SA group to supply it with more than 100 automated teller machines by the end of this year.</p>
<p>Olivetti Solutions Polska Sp z o.o. said in a statement last year it supplied Pekao SA with its first 42 cash on-line machines.</p>
<p>Olivetti officials would not disclose the value of the contract.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
